OL,3,GNEWSARail services disrupted by
OL,4,Aelectricity fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn electricity supply failure has
OL,7,Fcaused major disruption to rail
OL,8,Fservices.
OL,10,FThe fault occurred in Welwyn Garden
OL,11,FCity and is causing problems for
OL,12,Fservices running between London's
OL,13,FFinsbury Park and Stevenage.
OL,15,FLNER services between London King's
OL,16,FCross and Peterborough, as well as
OL,17,FThameslink and Great Northern services,
OL,18,Fare subject to delays and
OL,19,Fcancellations.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
